> -Close to the Beach<br> -High floor<br> -Unfurnished <br> -Allocated 2 Parking Spots<br> -Shared Gym and Pool<br> -Vacant Ready To Move<br> -Flexible Cheques <br> <br> Project Features :-<br> Al Jazi at Madinat Jumeirah Living (MJL) is a luxury Lw-Rise Building by Meraas, located near Burj Al Arab in Dubai. With views of the sea and city. It features lush green spaces, pools, gyms, kids’ play areas, Ideal for families, with a relaxed, upscale lifestyle near the beach.<br> <br> About the Community :-<br> <br> Madinat Jumeirah Living (MJL) is a premium freehold residential community by Dubai Holding, located across from the Burj Al Arab. With traditional Arabic-inspired architecture with modern interiors. Pedestrian-friendly, offers pools, gyms, kids’ areas, and direct access to Souk Madinat and the beach. MJL blends resort-style living with city convenience.<br> <br> Proximity :-<br> <br> It’s only 5 minutes walk to Jumeirah Beach and Burj Al Arab, 15 Minutes drive to The Dubai Mall and Burj Khalifa, 5 Minutes to The Mall Of Emirates so you don’t have to worry as you are close to all the Dubai iconic destinations!<br> <br>Get in touch now for more info and to arrange a viewing!","longitude":55.1957658,"negotiator_id":"11706","negotiator_mapping":"sahl@providentestate.com","parking":["2"],"price":469999,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"lettings","slug":"4-bedroom-apartment-to-rent-in-al-jazi-madinat-jumeirah-living-umm-suqeim-dubai","status":"To Let","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/ea9/ea9c853051b7c66eff41d44f103016f3/1.jpg","title":"4 bedroom apartment to rent","extra":{"views":"","cheques":"2","project":null,"bitrix_id":"1459452","furnished":"Unfurnished","permit_number":"71420965475","rental_period":"Yearly","current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Unfurnished","completion_status":"completed","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":[{"endDate":"